values ($lx$jenny-ho-do-glendale$lx$, (select id from public.business_categories where slug = $lx$medical$lx$), $lx$Jenny Ho, DO (Bookmark Medical)$lx$, null, $lx$Mandarin-speaking family medicine doctor at Bookmark Medical in Glendale, seeing children, teens and adults.$lx$, $lx$格倫代爾 Bookmark Medical 會說國語的家庭醫學科醫師，看診對象包括兒童、青少年及成人。$lx$, $lx$Dr. Jenny Ho is a family medicine physician (DO) at Bookmark Medical - Thunderbird, 5620 W Thunderbird Rd, Suite F-1, in Glendale. Dr. Ho has practiced since 2015, with clinical interests in women's health and preventive care, and sees children, teens, adults and seniors; telehealth visits are available. Dr. Ho attended medical school at Des Moines University, completed a residency at Phoenix Baptist Hospital and is a member of the American Academy of Family Physicians. The page lists English and Mandarin. When checked, the page said Dr. Ho was not accepting new patients. Languages as listed on Bookmark Medical's provider page, checked November 2026.$lx$, $lx$Jenny Ho 醫師是家庭醫學科醫師（DO），在格倫代爾（Glendale）5620 W Thunderbird Rd, Suite F-1 的 Bookmark Medical - Thunderbird 看診。Ho 醫師自 2015 年執業，關注女性健康與預防保健，看診對象包括兒童、青少年、成人及長者，也提供遠距看診。Ho 醫師畢業於 Des Moines University 醫學院，在 Phoenix Baptist Hospital 完成住院醫師訓練，是美國家庭醫師學會會員。頁面列出的語言為英語及國語。查核時頁面顯示目前不接受新病患。語言資訊依據 Bookmark Medical 醫師頁面，2026 年 11 月查核。$lx$, $lx$Glendale$lx$, $lx$Greater Phoenix$lx$, $lx$5620 W Thunderbird Rd, Suite F-1, Glendale, AZ 85306$lx$, null, $lx$(480) 716-5190$lx$, null, $lx$https://www.bookmarkmedical.com/providers/jenny-ho$lx$, array[$lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$]::text[], array[$lx$Jenny Ho, DO (Bookmark Medical)$lx$, $lx$Glendale$lx$, $lx$medical$lx$, $lx$bookmarkmedical.com$lx$, $lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$doctor physician$lx$, $lx$醫師 看診$lx$, $lx$Chinese-speaking$lx$, $lx$中文服務$lx$]::text[], true, true, false, false, false, $lx$live$lx$, $lx$editor_verified$lx$, now())
on conflict (slug) do nothing;

