values ($lx$vicky-chen-yang-md-peoria$lx$, (select id from public.business_categories where slug = $lx$medical$lx$), $lx$Vicky Chen-Yang, MD (HonorHealth)$lx$, null, $lx$Taiwan-born, Mandarin-speaking primary care doctor with HonorHealth in Peoria, experienced with older patients.$lx$, $lx$在台灣出生、會說國語的皮奧里亞 HonorHealth 基層醫療醫師，照顧長者經驗豐富。$lx$, $lx$Dr. Vicky Chen-Yang is a primary care physician with HonorHealth at 7831 W Deer Valley Rd in Peoria. HonorHealth lists Dr. Chen-Yang as board certified in internal medicine by the American Board of Internal Medicine and describes a practice in family medicine, including 15 years in Sun City West with extensive experience caring for older patients. Dr. Chen-Yang is originally from Taiwan and speaks Mandarin Chinese. Languages as listed on HonorHealth's Find a Doctor directory, checked November 2026.$lx$, $lx$Vicky Chen-Yang 醫師是 HonorHealth 的基層醫療醫師，在皮奧里亞（Peoria）7831 W Deer Valley Rd 看診。HonorHealth 列出其持有美國內科醫學委員會內科專科認證，主要從事家庭醫學，曾在 Sun City West 執業 15 年，照顧長者經驗豐富。Chen-Yang 醫師來自台灣，能說國語。語言資訊依據 HonorHealth「Find a Doctor」醫師名錄，2026 年 11 月查核。$lx$, $lx$Peoria$lx$, $lx$Greater Phoenix$lx$, $lx$7831 W Deer Valley Rd, Peoria, AZ 85382$lx$, null, $lx$(623) 312-2265$lx$, null, $lx$https://www.honorhealth.com/physicians/vicky-chen-yang$lx$, array[$lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$]::text[], array[$lx$Vicky Chen-Yang, MD (HonorHealth)$lx$, $lx$Peoria$lx$, $lx$medical$lx$, $lx$honorhealth.com$lx$, $lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$doctor physician$lx$, $lx$醫師 看診$lx$, $lx$Chinese-speaking$lx$, $lx$中文服務$lx$]::text[], true, true, false, false, false, $lx$live$lx$, $lx$editor_verified$lx$, now())
on conflict (slug) do nothing;

