values ($lx$lin-zhao-md-phoenix$lx$, (select id from public.business_categories where slug = $lx$medical$lx$), $lx$Lin Zhao, MD, MPH (HonorHealth)$lx$, null, $lx$Mandarin-speaking family and preventive medicine doctor with HonorHealth in far north Phoenix.$lx$, $lx$鳳凰城北部 HonorHealth 會說國語的家庭醫學及預防醫學醫師。$lx$, $lx$Dr. Lin Zhao (MD, MPH) is a family medicine physician with HonorHealth at 34975 N North Valley Pkwy, Suite 100, in far north Phoenix, with clinical interests in lifestyle medicine and preventive health. Dr. Zhao is board certified in preventive medicine (public health and general preventive medicine) by the American Board of Preventive Medicine and also holds certifications in clinical informatics and obesity medicine. HonorHealth lists English and Chinese, and the profile says Dr. Zhao is fluent in Mandarin Chinese. Languages as listed on HonorHealth's Find a Doctor directory, checked November 2026.$lx$, $lx$Lin Zhao 醫師（MD, MPH）是 HonorHealth 的家庭醫學科醫師，在鳳凰城北部 34975 N North Valley Pkwy, Suite 100 看診，關注生活型態醫學與預防保健。Zhao 醫師持有美國預防醫學委員會的預防醫學（公共衛生及一般預防醫學）專科認證，另有臨床資訊學及肥胖醫學認證。HonorHealth 列出的語言為英語及中文，個人簡介表示能說流利國語。語言資訊依據 HonorHealth「Find a Doctor」醫師名錄，2026 年 11 月查核。$lx$, $lx$Phoenix$lx$, $lx$Greater Phoenix$lx$, $lx$34975 N North Valley Pkwy, Suite 100, Phoenix, AZ$lx$, null, $lx$(623) 295-4820$lx$, null, $lx$https://www.honorhealth.com/physicians/lin-zhao$lx$, array[$lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$]::text[], array[$lx$Lin Zhao, MD, MPH (HonorHealth)$lx$, $lx$Phoenix$lx$, $lx$medical$lx$, $lx$honorhealth.com$lx$, $lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$doctor physician$lx$, $lx$醫師 看診$lx$, $lx$Chinese-speaking$lx$, $lx$中文服務$lx$]::text[], true, true, false, false, false, $lx$live$lx$, $lx$editor_verified$lx$, now())
on conflict (slug) do nothing;

